          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Rows 30, padding 8, radius 8 (concentric: 12 shell − 4 padding). A 14px lead slot holds an icon or a check, so labels align with or without icons. Group label 11/600, tracking 0.6, $fg-dim. Shortcut 11, $fg-dim. Destructive last, after a separator. Dropdown, context menu and select share one item component; context menu loses its rounded-sm. Item labels here are examples of the component, not new actions.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
