          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Nav sits flat on the page (no bg-card/50 tint), rows 30 with 14 icons, active = keycap, hover fg/3 — no bg-primary/10 blue. Search is the shared 30px field. Reset is set apart at the end. Content: section title 15/600 with one line of help, rows 64 with label, description and the control on the right. Choices use the keycap track; switches are neutral ($fg track when on) instead of bg-primary-fill. Setting names come from categories.tsx; the Cursor blink and Ligatures rows only show the switch style.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
