          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Shell on $popover (not bg-card), radius 14, 48px input band. Selected row = fg/6, the same highlight as every menu — it rises, where today’s data-[selected]:bg-background sinks. Icon chips are neutral outlines; project rows keep their colored glyph. Group labels 11/600 like every menu. Shortcuts use the same Kbd as the projects list. Footer hints sit in a hairline band on the same surface (no bg-background strip). Shortcut and description text here are placeholders; the real ones come from the command list.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
