              "content": "Sonner puts the icon, text, cancel button and action button in one row. Two buttons with icons leave the text about 30px, so the title and the long nightly version wrap one word per line. Fix: the text takes the full width, the buttons move to their own row on the right without icons (both fit in the 356px toast), and the version can break anywhere.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
